---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<header>
		<div class="header-inner">
			<img class="logo" src="/logo.png" alt="Podomy" />
			<nav>
				<a href="#projects">Projects</a>
				<a href="#pricing">Licensing</a>
				<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
			</nav>
		</div>
	</header>

	<section id="hero">
		<div class="hero-content">
			<h1>Distributed systems for<br />autonomous fleets</h1>
			<p class="hero-sub">
				Podomy builds distributed systems, runtimes, and infrastructure for machine fleets that cannot stay connected.
				Deploy workloads, keep operating through network partitions, and reconcile state deterministically.
			</p>
			<div class="hero-actions">
				<a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
				<a href="#projects" class="btn btn-secondary">Explore projects</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="projects">
		<div class="section-inner">
			<h2>Projects</h2>
			<p class="section-lede">
				Systems, runtimes, and protocols engineered from first principles for partition tolerance, decentralized coordination, and resilient fleets.
			</p>

			<div class="project-card">
				<div class="project-header">
					<div class="project-title">
						<h3>Concord</h3>
						<span class="badge">Runtime</span>
					</div>
					<p class="project-desc">
						A partition-native container and process runtime. Where traditional orchestrators assume continuous connectedness, Concord assumes partition—giving each node the local control logic to act autonomously and reconcile state upon reconnection.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="grid">
					<div class="card">
						<h3>Local admission</h3>
						<p>Each node decides what can run inside the bubble it can see.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="card">
						<h3>Append-only journal</h3>
						<p>Truth is a local durable event log. State, peers, and workloads are views.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="card">
						<h3>Sync &amp; reconcile</h3>
						<p>Reconnected nodes exchange missing events and merge deterministically.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="card">
						<h3>Workload contracts</h3>
						<p>Workloads declare multiplicity, authority, freshness, and merge behavior.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="card">
						<h3>Executor plugins</h3>
						<p>Containerd runs first. Other executors can support heterogeneous fleets later.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="card">
						<h3>Honest observability</h3>
						<p>Concord classifies everything as known, unknown, stale, conflicted, confirmed, or unconfirmed.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="architecture">
		<div class="section-inner">
			<h2>Why this exists</h2>
			<p class="section-lede">
				Traditional cloud models assume high-bandwidth, always-on networks. Real-world distributed systems operate across physical boundaries, RF shadows, and disconnected domains.
			</p>
			<div class="use-cases">
				<div class="use-case">
					<h3>Mining &amp; heavy industry</h3>
					<p>Underground and remote fleets operate through RF gaps where connectivity is intermittent and downtime is expensive.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="use-case">
					<h3>Maritime &amp; subsea</h3>
					<p>AUVs and vessels dive, lose comms, surface, and sync. Partition is normal.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="use-case">
					<h3>Defense &amp; contested robotics</h3>
					<p>Mobile assets need software that works reliably without a persistent cloud or centralized network.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="pricing" class="alt">
		<div class="section-inner">
			<h2>Licensing</h2>
			<p class="section-lede">
				Concord is AGPL. Commercial licenses are available for companies that cannot open-source their modifications.
			</p>
			<div class="pricing-grid">
				<div class="pricing-card">
					<h3>AGPL</h3>
					<p class="price">Free</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Full runtime</li>
						<li>Local API &amp; CLI</li>
						<li>All workload classes</li>
						<li>Sync &amp; reconciliation engine</li>
						<li>Must open-source modifications</li>
					</ul>
					<a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Get started</a>
				</div>
				<div class="pricing-card featured">
					<h3>Commercial license</h3>
					<p class="price">Contact us</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Everything in AGPL</li>
						<li>No open-source requirement</li>
						<li>Enterprise support</li>
						<li>Priority feature development</li>
						<li>Observability &amp; debugging tooling</li>
					</ul>
					<a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact sales</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="contact">
		<div class="section-inner">
			<h2>Get in touch</h2>
			<p class="section-lede">
				We are looking for design partners building software for fleets that cannot stay connected.
			</p>
			<div class="contact-links">
				<a href="mailto:hello@podomy.com" class="btn btn-primary">hello@podomy.com</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<footer>
		<div class="footer-inner">
			<div class="footer-left">
				<img class="logo" src="/logo.png" alt="Podomy" />
				<span class="legal">A product of Forge Universal LLC</span>
			</div>
			<div class="footer-right">
				<a href="/terms/">Terms</a>
				<a href="mailto:hello@podomy.com">hello@podomy.com</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</footer>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* Header */
	header {
		position: fixed;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		z-index: 100;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
	}

	.header-inner {
		max-width: 880px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 10px 24px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
	}

	.logo {
		display: block;
		width: 44px;
		height: auto;
	}

	nav {
		display: flex;
		gap: 24px;
	}

	nav a {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: #71717a;
		transition: color 0.2s;
	}

	nav a:hover {
		color: #18181b;
	}

	/* Hero */
	#hero {
		padding: 96px 24px 64px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-height: 64vh;
	}

	.hero-content {
		max-width: 640px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.1;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		color: #18181b;
		margin: 0 0 18px;
	}

	.hero-sub {
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: #52525b;
		margin: 0 0 28px;
		max-width: 560px;
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 16px;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.btn {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 10px 22px;
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: all 0.2s;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.btn-primary {
		background: #000;
		color: #fff;
	}

	.btn-primary:hover {
		background: #27272a;
		color: #fff;
	}

	.btn-secondary {
		background: #f4f4f5;
		color: #27272a;
	}

	.btn-secondary:hover {
		background: #e4e4e7;
		color: #18181b;
	}

	/* Sections */
	section {
		padding: 64px 24px;
	}

	section.alt {
		background: #fafafa;
	}

	.section-inner {
		max-width: 880px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: 1.625rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #18181b;
		margin: 0 0 10px;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}

	.section-lede {
		font-size: 0.98rem;
		color: #52525b;
		margin: 0 0 32px;
		max-width: 640px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	/* Projects */
	.project-card {
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	.project-header {
		margin-bottom: 24px;
	}

	.project-title {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
	}

	.project-title h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #18181b;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.badge {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: 0.6875rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		padding: 2px 8px;
		background: #f4f4f5;
		color: #52525b;
		border-radius: 4px;
		border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
	}

	.project-desc {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: #52525b;
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.7;
		max-width: 680px;
	}

	/* Grid */
	.grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 16px;
	}

	.card {
		padding: 12px 0;
	}

	.card h3 {
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #18181b;
		margin: 0 0 8px;
	}

	.card p {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: #52525b;
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	/* Use cases */
	.use-cases {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 16px;
	}

	.use-case {
		padding-left: 0;
	}

	.use-case h3 {
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #18181b;
		margin: 0 0 8px;
	}

	.use-case p {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: #52525b;
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* Pricing */
	.pricing-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 16px;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	.pricing-card {
		padding: 24px;
	}

	.pricing-card.featured {
		background: #fafafa;
	}

	.pricing-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #18181b;
		margin: 0 0 8px;
	}

	.price {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #000;
		margin: 0 0 18px;
	}

	.pricing-card ul {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0 0 22px;
	}

	.pricing-card li {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: #52525b;
		padding: 6px 0;
	}

	.pricing-card li::before {
		content: "+ ";
		color: #000;
	}

	.pricing-card .btn {
		display: block;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.footnote {
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		color: #71717a;
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* Contact */
	.contact-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 16px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.contact-links .btn {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
	}

	/* Footer */
	footer {
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
		padding: 24px;
	}

	.footer-inner {
		max-width: 880px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.footer-left {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 12px;
	}

	.footer-left .logo {
		width: 32px;
	}

	.legal {
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		color: #a1a1aa;
	}

	.footer-right a {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: #a1a1aa;
	}

	.footer-right {
		display: flex;
		gap: 16px;
	}

	.footer-right a:hover {
		color: #52525b;
	}

	/* Responsive */
	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		h1 {
			font-size: 2.25rem;
		}

		.grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.use-cases {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.pricing-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		section {
			padding: 64px 20px;
		}

		#hero {
			padding: 120px 20px 64px;
		}
	}
</style>
